1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,049
A mechanical wave needs a medium with two properties.

2
00:00:04,049 --> 00:00:07,955
Elasticity, to pull each displaced particle back.

3
00:00:07,955 --> 00:00:13,268
And inertia, so that the particle overshoots and passes the motion on.

4
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:17,434
Light and radio waves are different: they need no medium at all.

